    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273220/extras/02f74e45035bed71aaa9bcdb7284039e.avif?t=1728993220\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ascend to greater heights with the <strong>Sphere - Flying Cities | Save the World Edition</strong> and bling out your city with the exclusive <strong>Save the World Skin</strong> for <strong>five</strong> buildings like the indispensable Anti Gravity Device. But that's not all: Take a deep-dive into the fascinating architecture of Sphere - Flying Cities with the offical <strong>Sphere-Mini-Artbook</strong>! This Premium Edition is a great way to show appreciation for the developers, while simultaneously supporting a good cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273220/extras/e6e37462eefe01de17f188d21b0a7e09.poster.avif?t=1728993220\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273220/extras/e6e37462eefe01de17f188d21b0a7e09.webm?t=1728993220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273220/extras/e6e37462eefe01de17f188d21b0a7e09.mp4?t=1728993220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the not-so-distant future, Earth\u2019s moon has been struck by a massive asteroid. With the fallout rendering the terrestrial surface uninhabitable, the ecosystem of the planet collapses. Facing complete annihilation, humanity makes one final and desperate attempt to survive \u2014 thanks to newly-created anti-gravity technology, the first flying city ascends as the ultimate bastion of the human race. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273220/extras/7628d5f5c438196cb10ba4d1ae462a68.poster.avif?t=1728993220\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273220/extras/7628d5f5c438196cb10ba4d1ae462a68.webm?t=1728993220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273220/extras/7628d5f5c438196cb10ba4d1ae462a68.mp4?t=1728993220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Commander, you have been chosen to take control over the flying city in this relentless and unique strategy-blend that combines the best elements of the city-building and survival-game genres. Rebuild and protect a society in a seemingly uninhabitable environment. Utilize the Anti-Gravitation device to navigate your flying city across the globe into the treacherous unknown. Stay vigilant, as each decision could have ghastly consequences; be prepared to lay it all on the line to succeed, else risk losing everything you worked for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273220/extras/18aa4b8f8488906435ec07eeb7872857.poster.avif?t=1728993220\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273220/extras/18aa4b8f8488906435ec07eeb7872857.webm?t=1728993220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273220/extras/18aa4b8f8488906435ec07eeb7872857.mp4?t=1728993220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build It and They Will Come:</strong> Erect a living, thriving city and maintain your ecosystem via resource management mastery and infrastructure supported by independent economic cycles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Do not Look Down:</strong> Ensure your anti-gravity device and its expanding deflector shield are always kept in tip-top shape, as an insufficient power supply will result in a quick demise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Send in the Robots:</strong> Utilize drones and other scout technologies in hazardous environments to construct buildings, harvest resources, and search for stranded survivors and rare materials in uncharted territories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Scientist in Space:</strong> Research new technologies to improve the efficiency of every aspect of your city and withstand a plethora of (un)natural disasters like geomagnetic storms, asteroids, and poisonous clouds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Delicate Ecosystem:</strong> The well-being of your people is crucial to the success of the mission. Carefully tend to the needs of your colonists by supplying food, healthcare, and shelter. But don\u2019t forget, the survival of many may require the deaths of the few. Sacrifices are an inevitable imperative.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273220/extras/4eaf28310cd34a00424028e95387d4a5.avif?t=1728993220\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273220/extras/02f74e45035bed71aaa9bcdb7284039e.avif?t=1728993220\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ascend to greater heights with the <strong>Sphere - Flying Cities | Save the World Edition</strong> and bling out your city with the exclusive <strong>Save the World Skin</strong> for <strong>five</strong> buildings like the indispensable Anti Gravity Device. But that's not all: Take a deep-dive into the fascinating architecture of Sphere - Flying Cities with the offical <strong>Sphere-Mini-Artbook</strong>! This Premium Edition is a great way to show appreciation for the developers, while simultaneously supporting a good cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273220/extras/e6e37462eefe01de17f188d21b0a7e09.poster.avif?t=1728993220\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273220/extras/e6e37462eefe01de17f188d21b0a7e09.webm?t=1728993220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273220/extras/e6e37462eefe01de17f188d21b0a7e09.mp4?t=1728993220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the not-so-distant future, Earth\u2019s moon has been struck by a massive asteroid. With the fallout rendering the terrestrial surface uninhabitable, the ecosystem of the planet collapses. Facing complete annihilation, humanity makes one final and desperate attempt to survive \u2014 thanks to newly-created anti-gravity technology, the first flying city ascends as the ultimate bastion of the human race. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273220/extras/7628d5f5c438196cb10ba4d1ae462a68.poster.avif?t=1728993220\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273220/extras/7628d5f5c438196cb10ba4d1ae462a68.webm?t=1728993220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273220/extras/7628d5f5c438196cb10ba4d1ae462a68.mp4?t=1728993220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Commander, you have been chosen to take control over the flying city in this relentless and unique strategy-blend that combines the best elements of the city-building and survival-game genres. Rebuild and protect a society in a seemingly uninhabitable environment. Utilize the Anti-Gravitation device to navigate your flying city across the globe into the treacherous unknown. Stay vigilant, as each decision could have ghastly consequences; be prepared to lay it all on the line to succeed, else risk losing everything you worked for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273220/extras/18aa4b8f8488906435ec07eeb7872857.poster.avif?t=1728993220\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273220/extras/18aa4b8f8488906435ec07eeb7872857.webm?t=1728993220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273220/extras/18aa4b8f8488906435ec07eeb7872857.mp4?t=1728993220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build It and They Will Come:</strong> Erect a living, thriving city and maintain your ecosystem via resource management mastery and infrastructure supported by independent economic cycles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Do not Look Down:</strong> Ensure your anti-gravity device and its expanding deflector shield are always kept in tip-top shape, as an insufficient power supply will result in a quick demise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Send in the Robots:</strong> Utilize drones and other scout technologies in hazardous environments to construct buildings, harvest resources, and search for stranded survivors and rare materials in uncharted territories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Scientist in Space:</strong> Research new technologies to improve the efficiency of every aspect of your city and withstand a plethora of (un)natural disasters like geomagnetic storms, asteroids, and poisonous clouds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Delicate Ecosystem:</strong> The well-being of your people is crucial to the success of the mission. Carefully tend to the needs of your colonists by supplying food, healthcare, and shelter. But don\u2019t forget, the survival of many may require the deaths of the few. Sacrifices are an inevitable imperative.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273220/extras/4eaf28310cd34a00424028e95387d4a5.avif?t=1728993220\" /></div></p>",
    "short_description": "Sphere \u2013 Flying Cities is a sci-fi citybuilder which combines strategy, simulation, and survival elements in an extraordinary and immersive scenario. Rebuild and protect a society in a unique and hostile environment. Pay the price for your decisions and be prepared to lose everything.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, French, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
